; Import definitions for the user32 functions winsmbftp.c (WinSMBFTP.exe)
; calls - window class/creation, the message loop, and basic dialogs. Same
; format and reasoning as ws2_32.def; see winport\wingui.h for the declarations.
LIBRARY user32.dll
EXPORTS
CreateWindowExA
DefWindowProcA
DestroyWindow
DispatchMessageA
EnableWindow
GetClientRect
GetMessageA
GetWindowTextA
LoadCursorA
LoadIconA
MessageBoxA
MoveWindow
PostMessageA
PostQuitMessage
RegisterClassExA
SendMessageA
SetForegroundWindow
SetWindowTextA
ShowWindow
TranslateMessage
UpdateWindow
